---
title: "join (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Coin c destructured to (id, balance)
    q_destruct --> q_delete: id.delete()
    q_delete --> q_join: self.balance.join(balance)
    q_join --> [*]: coin c consumed into self

    note right of q_join
        INV-001: self.balance_post = self.balance_pre + c.balance
        INV-002: coin c is destroyed (id deleted)
        INV-003: no supply change
    end note
